These scripts instruct the framework to use Vinxi for starting up a development server, bundling production builds, and serving the production build.
Make sure to also set `"type"` to `"module"` so that Vite can properly transpile the React code for a browser.
In the root directory, create a file `app.config.ts`.
This config file is for initializing installed Vite plugins.
Use the file to initialize the `vite-tsconfig-paths` plugin:
